nts/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"放个《周刊万魔殿》的书摊在这的话……","text_original":"ここに「週刊万魔殿」のスタンドを置いたら……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"这个！伊吹肯定会喜欢的！","text_original":"これは！イブキちゃん大喜び間違いなしですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"下期特辑就决定是这个了！","text_original":"次の特集は、これに決めた！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_CommonSkill.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"在~！叫我吗~？","text_original":"は～い！お呼びですか～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"来拍些下期能用的照片吧～","text_original":"次号に使えそうな写真、撮っていきますよ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"老师，张嘴~啊~！","text_original":"先生、あ～んしてください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"没错，这个就是“万魔殿特制巧克力”哦！怎么样？甜甜的，很好吃吧！","text_original":"はいっ、今のは「万魔殿特製チョコ」でした！どうですか？甘くておいしいですよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLobby_4","category":"event","text":"虽然我很喜欢音乐和美食……但果然，和老师在一起时就会感觉不一样呢！","text_original":"素敵な音楽も、美味しい料理も好きですけど…やっぱり、先生と一緒だとなんか違いますね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"哇~！好多好玩的东西！","text_original":"わ～！お楽しみがいっぱい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"老师！这边！坐我旁边！我给老师留了个位置哦~！","text_original":"先生！こっちです！私の隣！先生の席、とってありますよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"真热闹呢~！老师，玩得开心吗~？","text_original":"盛り上がってますね～！先生、楽しんでますか～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLogin_Season_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"欢乐的派对也进入尾声了！尽情享受到最后吧～！","text_original":"楽しいパーティーも大詰め！最後まで満喫していきましょ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"event","text":"虽然发生了很多事…但太棒了！真是一段开心的时光！","text_original":"いろいろありましたけど…最っ高に！楽しい時間でした！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_EventLogin_Season_End.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"有大新闻的味道……啊哈！被发现了！","text_original":"ネタの匂いが……あはっ！バレちゃいました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExSkill_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"嗯嗯，原来如此……哇！危险！","text_original":"ふむふむなるほど……？わっ！危ない！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExSkill_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"让我看看……？啊哈哈！不好！快逃~！","text_original":"どれどれ……？あはは！やっば！逃げろ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExSkill_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"好的，请！","text_original":"はい、どうぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"我正在取材哦！","text_original":"今取材中なんで！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"稍~微会有点痛哦~？","text_original":"ちょ～っと痛みますよ～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"好耶~！我超开心的！比拿到独家爆料还要开心……！","text_original":"やった～！すっごく嬉しいです！特ダネゲットした時と同じかそれ以上に……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_ExWeapon_Get.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"需要帮忙吗？","text_original":"お手伝いが必要ですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Formation_In_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"也许能发现不错的新闻呢~","text_original":"いいネタ、見つかるかも～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Formation_In_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Formation_Select","category":"formation","text":"准备OK！","text_original":"準備オッケーです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Formation_Select.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"号外！号~外~！万魔殿书记元宫千明抵达夏莱~！","text_original":"号外！ごうが～い！万魔殿の書紀、元宮チアキがシャーレに到着しましたよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"哇啊！谢谢你！老师！","text_original":"わあっ！ありがとうございます！先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"好！我会继续燃烧书记之魂，权力前进的~！","text_original":"はいっ！これからも書記魂を燃やして、ガンガンいきますよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"感觉自己稍微变强了些！现在去宣传《周刊万魔殿》的话，感觉也会进行得很顺利……！","text_original":"すこし強くなった気がします！今なら「週刊万魔殿」の勧誘活動もうまくいきそうな……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"哇啊~！好开心！感觉快要飞到天上去了！老师！来拍张合影吧！来，茄子！","text_original":"わあ～！嬉しい！今なら空も飛べちゃいそうです！先生！写真撮りますから、一緒に映ってください！はい、チーズ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"到！元宫千明，正在待命~！有什么新闻……有什么需要我帮忙吗~？","text_original":"は～い！元宮チアキ、ただいま待機中で～す！何かネタ……お手伝いすることはありますか～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"这周的《周刊万魔殿》、你读了吗？特别附录的《可爱伊吹写真集》超棒哦！","text_original":"今週の「週刊万魔殿」、読みました？特別付録の「かわいいイブキちゃんブロマイド」がもう最高で！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"这是准备登在下周《周刊万魔殿》上的真琴学姐的照片……诶？太小了根本看不清？","text_original":"これ、来週の「週刊万魔殿」に載せるマコト先輩の写真なんですけど～……はい？小さすぎて全然見えない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"工作中的老师！好，眼睛看这边~！","text_original":"お仕事中の先生の姿！はい！目線くださ～い！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"表情太僵硬了~好，放松放松~","text_original":"表情固いですよ～はい、リラックスリラックス～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"无论是书记还是值日生，我什么都能做哦！随时吩咐吧，老师！","text_original":"書記としても、当番としても、なんでもやりますから！いつでも言ってくださいね、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊！欢迎回来，老师~！快点采访吧，如何~？","text_original":"あっ！先生おかえりなさい～！早速インタビューを始めたいんですが、いいですか～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_LogIn_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"你好啊，老师~！今天也要加把劲努力哦~！","text_original":"こんにちは、先生～！今日も一日、張り切っていきましょう～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_LogIn_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊哈哈！抓住快门时机啦！","text_original":"あははっ！シャッターチャンス、とらえました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师的睡颜！当下期的封面正好合适！","text_original":"居眠りする先生の顔！次号の表紙にピッタリです！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"这下《周刊万魔殿》特刊就准备完全啦！","text_original":"これで「週刊万魔殿」特集号の準備は万全！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不愧是我！又抓到独家新闻了~！","text_original":"さっすが私！またスクープをゲットしちゃいました～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"哼哼，可别小看书记的行动力哦~？","text_original":"ふふっ、書記の行動力、侮っちゃいけませんよ～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"对了！要不就趁这个势头，揭开老师身上的谜团如何……？","text_original":"そうだ！この勢いで、先生の謎に迫っていきましょうか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"袜子破洞之谜，之类的……！","text_original":"靴下に空いた穴の謎、とか……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"诶？坏孩子要处以“关在桌底之刑”……！？","text_original":"えっ！意地悪な子は「机の下閉じ込めの刑」に処す……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"对、对不起~！放我出去~！","text_original":"ご、ごめんなさ～い！出してください～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"啊哈哈……总感觉有点，不好意思呢！","text_original":"あははっ……なんだかちょっと、照れますね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"这是……我好开心。诶……感觉比平时温顺些？我吗？没，没那回事吧~！","text_original":"これは……嬉しいです。え……いつもより大人しい？私が、ですか？そ、そんなことないですよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"呜呜~真是的！这种时候，到底该露出怎样的表情才好啊！","text_original":"うう～もう！こういうとき、どんな顔をすればいいのか分かりません！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"那个，我不是很善于表达！但是我……想再多采访下老师！不行，吗……？","text_original":"あのっ、うまく言葉にできないのですが！もう少しだけ……先生を取材したい気分です！だめ、ですかね……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"咦，说起来今天是我的生日呢。太专注于编辑工作搞得我都忘了~！啊哈哈，谢谢老师~！","text_original":"あれっ、そういえば私の誕生日でしたね。編集に夢中で忘れてました～！あはは、ありがとうございます～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Season_Birthday.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐！我特地准备了“老师诞生之日”特辑！现在开始采访哦，麻烦回答一下问题！","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます！「先生が生まれた日」特集を組んでみました！それではインタビューの回答、お願いします！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"今天这一刻，我期待了好~久！街上到处都是奇装异服的人！我去和他们交个朋友～！","text_original":"今日のこの日をず～っと、楽しみにしてました！街中に変わった人がいっぱい！友達になってきますね～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Season_Halloween.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐！老师请作为《周刊万魔殿》新年刊的第一位读者吧！","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございます！先生には「週刊万魔殿」の新年号、最初の読者になっていただきます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Season_NewYear.ogg"},{"description":"CH0238_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐~！来来，站在圣诞树前！我要拍照喽~！","text_original":"メリークリスマスです～！ささ、ツリーの前に立ってください！写真、撮りますよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%85%83%E5%AE%AB%20%E5%8D%83%E6%98%8E/original/jp/CH0238_Season_Xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH023